## Add a Hosting Server

{% steps %}
1. Set up API access using the guide for your [control panel](#supported-integrations)
2. In the FOSSBilling admin panel, go to **System → Hosting Plans and Servers** and select **New Server**
3. Enter the server name, hostname, and IP address. Add the nameservers your hosting accounts should use, if applicable.
4. Under **Connection Settings**, select the **Server Manager** and enter the credentials from your panel guide. Set **Connection Port** if your panel uses a custom port.
5. Select **Add Server**
{% /steps %}
